        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Without WtM on it the Kraken picks a target and the damage is dealt.\nWith WtM on it the Kraken still picks a target but the damage is redirected to another target and the damage is dealt.\n\nAnother target means \"Not the original target\" and as TheJayMann rightly points out in his example, Argent Adept is the 'original target' of the Kraken's damage, any target other than Argent Adept is a valid target... including the Kraken. The card targeted by WtM has no bearing on the target that the damage is redirected to, they are two entirely separate targeting effects.",
